WEBVTT

00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:18,270
really speaking, how successful is rife for colon cancer? It's very successful for colon cancer.

00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:26,910
There's not very many cancers that we haven't seen literally miracles with the rife

00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:33,390
machine. But the truth is, is that you don't see miracles with the rife machine with every person

00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:43,710
regardless of what cancer it is. But I can't think of one cancer that I would say, oh,

00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:49,150
rife just doesn't work for that. Because we have had people, you know, I've been doing this

00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:57,310
a long time and we've treated just about every cancer you could think of, even rare ones. And

00:00:57,710 --> 00:01:06,030
we've seen miracles with all of them. So, but certainly, it certainly doesn't work for everybody.

00:01:06,030 --> 00:01:12,750
It's not a magic weapon for cancer. Though, again, I've said over and over, I wouldn't try

00:01:12,750 --> 00:01:18,910
to treat cancer without it. But yeah, certainly if I had cancer, if I had colon cancer, any cancer,

00:01:18,910 --> 00:01:28,910
I'd be using the rife.

